  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Juvenile Justice, Serb-Mo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ungdomsbrottslighet, SaM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projekt avser st&#xf6;d till reformering av lagstiftning kring ungdomsbrottslighet i Serbien och Montenegro. Projektet implementeras av Unicef och inkluderar samtliga r&#xe4;ttsv&#xe5;rdande myndigheter liksom ber&#xf6;rda barn och deras familjer. St&#xf6;d avser dels direkt st&#xf6;d i lagstiftningsarbete men &#xe4;ven utbildning av personal samt  rehabiliteringsaktiviteter. Projektperiod 2003-2006.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to prmote the comprehensive and multi-disciplinary reform of the juvenile justice system in Serbia and Montenegro in order to protect the rights of the children at risk and children in conflict with the law. The activities are both aimed at supporting the harmonization of laws, but also training of personnel and rehabilitation of juveniles.</narrative>
  </description>
